## Feature checklist (orbit, dock, transports, combat)

- [ ] Read `mapW` / `mapH` from `MapStateSingleton` (or `ToroidalMapEcs` after bootstrap)
- [ ] New movers wrap after physics (skip when size is unset — never invent 1000×1000)
- [ ] Gameplay ranges use toroidal math — not raw XZ `distance`
- [ ] Presentation follows wrapped sim — no per-body display tiles
- [ ] No new GameObject / collider copies for wrap
- [ ] Do not add client map-body gathers that bypass `ClientJoinSettleCache.ShouldSkipMapBodyQueries`

**Orbit ring / people transport:** ring membership = `PlanetOrbitMath.IsInOrbitRing(ToroidalDistance(...), inner, outer)`.
Tangents use `ShortestOffsetXZ(planet → ship)` so clockwise orbit works across opposite edges.

